Backport of upstream c953b39f9487 ("drm/amd/display: Reintroduce \"Force
validation link training on all ASICs\"", Ivan Lipski, in 7.3-rc1) to 7.2.

skip_frl_pretraining makes a re-detect on an active link non-destructive, so
FRL is never re-verified: after any sink-side HPD the sink stays TMDS, 8K60
fails validation and disappears from the connector's mode list. Upstream drops
the flag; 7.2 has no replacement field, so the branch goes away entirely.

